@startuml CovAI_Pipeline_Part2
title <b>CovAI Pipeline (Part 2): Extended Quality, LLM/RAG Evaluation & AI Test Generation</b>\n<size:12>IEEE / ACM Standard - Non-functional Testing, RAG Triad Benchmarks, and Automated Test Synthesis</size>

skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam padding 12

skinparam ArrowColor #1B4F72
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowFontColor #2C3E50

skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
  BorderColor #7F8C8D
  FontColor #154360
  FontStyle bold
  BorderThickness 1.3
}

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #34495E
  BorderThickness 1.3
  FontColor #1C2833
}

' INPUT FROM PART 1
package "INPUT ARTIFACTS (RECEIVED FROM PART 1)" as InPart2 {
  rectangle "<b>Static & Dynamic Analysis Data</b>\n---\n• AST Tree, CFG Graph & CC Complexity\n• Coverage Metrics & Uncovered Gap Map\n• Integration (Supertest) & E2E Test Logs" as In_Data #EAEDED
  rectangle "<b>Test Resources & Configurations</b>\n---\n• Isolated Docker Sandbox Environment\n• RAG Golden Dataset & LLM API Endpoints\n• Application Source Code Under Test" as In_Env #EAEDED
}

' 5. EXTENDED QUALITY & LLM/RAG EVALUATION
package "5. EXTENDED QUALITY & LLM/RAG EVALUATION PIPELINES" as L5 {
  rectangle "<b>Performance Testing Engine</b>\n---\n• Function execution time profiling\n• Latency risk scoring (High CC + Slow runtime)\n• API load & stress testing via k6 / Artillery" as Perf #F4ECF7
  
  rectangle "<b>Security Testing (SAST & AI)</b>\n---\n• Static pattern rules: Hardcoded secrets, eval, exec\n• Dependency vulnerability audit: npm audit / CVE\n• Gemini AI Security Scan: SQLi, XSS, Insecure Crypto" as Sec #F4ECF7

  rectangle "<b>LLM / RAG Evaluation Engine (LLM-as-a-Judge)</b>\n---\n• <b>RAG Triad:</b> Faithfulness, Relevance, Precision\n• <b>LLM Safety:</b> Prompt Injection, Toxicity, JSON Schema\n• <b>Operational:</b> TTFT Latency & Token Cost Estimation\n• Automated evaluation via Gemini Evaluator" as RAG #F5EEF8
}

' 6. AI TEST GENERATION & REPAIR
package "6. AI TEST GENERATION & REPAIR ENGINE" as L6 {
  rectangle "<b>AI Context & Prompt Builder</b>\n---\n• Synthesizes: Source + AST + CFG + CC\n• Injects Uncovered Gaps & Missing Branches\n• Constructs structured, framework-tailored prompts" as Ctx #EBF5FB
  
  rectangle "<b>Google Gemini Generative AI Model</b>\n---\n• Generates Test Skeletons (describe/it structure)\n• Synthesizes Full Runnable Test Suites\n• Proposes automated refactoring suggestions" as AI #EBF5FB
  
  rectangle "<b>Syntax Validator & Fallback Engine</b>\n---\n• Validates AST syntax of generated test code\n• Fallback mechanism: Wraps failing tests into test.todo()\n• Re-executes in Docker to confirm new coverage\n• Guarantees 100% runnable test suite delivery" as Rep #EBF5FB
}

' 7. OUTPUT ARTIFACTS & VISUALIZATION
package "7. OUTPUT ARTIFACTS & DASHBOARD VISUALIZATION" as L7 {
  rectangle "<b>Interactive Code & CFG Viewer</b>\n---\n• React Flow interactive graph canvas\n• Heatmap highlighting CC complexity hotspots" as OutCFG #E8F8F5
  
  rectangle "<b>Coverage Dashboard</b>\n---\n• 4-Dimension coverage gauge (Stmt/Branch/Func/Line)\n• Source code viewer with highlighted uncovered lines" as OutCov #E8F8F5
  
  rectangle "<b>Unified Quality Scorecard & RAG Radar</b>\n---\n• Overall codebase health score (0 - 100)\n• RAG Triad performance radar chart\n• Prioritized security & performance findings" as OutSc #E8F8F5
  
  rectangle "<b>Deployable Test Artifacts</b>\n---\n• Fully runnable *.test.js test suite files\n• Comprehensive audit report (JSON / PDF)\n• Direct integration into CI/CD pipelines" as OutTest #E8F8F5
}

' Data flows
In_Data --> Ctx : Source code & Uncovered Gaps
In_Data --> Perf : Function metrics & CC scores
In_Env --> Perf : Triggers k6 inside Docker
In_Env --> Sec : Scans source & dependencies
In_Env --> RAG : Golden Dataset & LLM API

Ctx --> AI : Structured Prompt
AI --> Rep : Generated test suite
Rep --> OutTest : Exports runnable *.test.js
Rep --> OutCov : Updates post-generation coverage

In_Data --> OutCFG : Renders CFG & CC
In_Data --> OutCov : Baseline 4-Dim Coverage

Perf --> OutSc : Performance scores & bottlenecks
Sec --> OutSc : Security vulnerability list
RAG --> OutSc : RAG Triad scores & Radar Chart

@enduml
